1309:Generated_Source\PSoC5/cyPm.c **** *
1310:Generated_Source\PSoC5/cyPm.c **** *  Prepare device for proper Hibernate low power mode entry:
1311:Generated_Source\PSoC5/cyPm.c **** *  - Disables I2C backup regulator
